# Copy to .env.local and fill in real values from your Supabase project.
#
# Supabase key terminology:
#   - NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY is safe for the browser. It is used
#     for user-session clients (subject to Row Level Security) and replaces the
#     legacy "anon" key.
#   - SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY is a server-only privileged key that bypasses RLS.
#     It replaces the legacy "service role" key. Never expose it to the
#     browser or to client-side code. It is not used by the SSR clients yet;
#     it is reserved for server-side work such as Trigger.dev jobs and admin
#     tasks.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=